{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13602140","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13602140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1360214001:0":{"text":"雪松镇的排查和净化交由顿里尔与洛桑，你们则前往荒角沙漠。","source_cn":"雪松镇的排查和净化交由顿里尔与洛桑，你们则前往荒角沙漠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A137BF2EADF6653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360214002:1":{"text":"刚来到乌尔氏族附近，你们就听到了交战的声音。","source_cn":"刚来到乌尔氏族附近，你们就听到了交战的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD9D98C6E2530F3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360214003:1":{"text":"暗中伤人的卑鄙者！战斗，应该堂堂正正！","source_cn":"暗中伤人的卑鄙者！战斗，应该堂堂正正！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB690D1A4EDD09293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360214004:1":{"text":"开什么玩笑，我没有偷袭你。","source_cn":"开什么玩笑，我没有偷袭你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF46EEDF0FE255009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360214005:1":{"text":"是你先偷袭我。","source_cn":"是你先偷袭我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2689D3A837592E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360214006:1":{"text"